Hi Patrick,
I don't see a better approach in general. The implimentation could be
cleaned up, along the lines of

x.w <- as.data.frame(cast(x, id ~ time))
x.w$dif <- x.w$t2009 - x.w$t2006
x.new <http://x.new> <- rename(melt(x.w, measure.vars = c("t2006", "t2009")),
		c(variable = "time"))
x.new <http://x.new>$id <- reorder(x.new <http://x.new>$id, x.new <http://x.new>$dif)

HTH,
Ista

