(2) the products should be ordered by category and then weight; so I can see both for weight and rating in the same order
(3) the legends using count is a bit disappointing since for weight I use 100 as the axis crossing; thus I want count appearing close to the left if <100 and close to the right of the bar if >100; similarly for rating in which 0 is used as the axis crossing
(4) for each category, I tried to use 3 different color to label, so far it is just appearing not right

any suggestions?
thanks.
Jack

