> > is to use geom_segment(), but that geom assumes a
> numeric x and
> > numeric y, so we have to add a couple more variables
> to the mix. Just
> > as an alternative, I show one way to get (almost) the
> same data frame
> > as Josh's ltest using the reshape package's melt()
