> >    scale_colour_manual(values = c('A' = 'purple',
> 'B' = 'blue', C= 'green')) +
> >    opts(legend.position = 'none', title = "Weight
> and rating of all samples")
> >
> >
> > It looks pretty much the same as the lattice graph,
