Error in if (empty(new)) return(data.frame()) :

  missing value where TRUE/FALSE needed
> ABC.g    + stat_contour(aes(x=x,y=y,z=z),breaks=c(10, 500, 1000))
> ABC.g    + stat_contour(aes(x=x,y=y,z=z),breaks=c(5, 500, 1000))
> ABC.g    + stat_contour(aes(x=x,y=y,z=z),breaks=c(1, 500, 1000))

Error in if (empty(new)) return(data.frame()) :

  missing value where TRUE/FALSE needed
> ABC.g    + stat_contour(aes(x=x,y=y,z=z),breaks=c(2, 500, 1000))

It doesn't like it when there isn't a low number, but it doesn't like 0 either.

I don't know enough to help, but hopefully that helps someone else who might.

Brandon

